   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello, I am doing a study on the monitoring of small mammals using camera traps and live traps. I would like to use the functions (Mark Recapture Distance Sampling, and Camera Trap Distance Sampling) of the distance tool for the analysis of my data. I would like to have documentation concerning these functions. I would also like to have examples of data on this subject. THANKS<br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div><span class=\"gmail_signature_prefix\">-- </span><br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><font color=\"#000000\">Abdou-Wakilou</font></span></div></div><br><img width=\"0\" height=\"0\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:flex\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/So_VKEBCnhEbUcT3QODYvlG8-ZRYTL7rwW7l8krtHtJHVapWn_2u4Thz0xOt_G8u1Vlu4ypO5LgFLC5orPVbY2FcTSTgs-YMlp11lpj-o2lf4Id7oqJ-Pz_GHWsWcDK88o0wv_QWZ1F2=s0-d-e1-ft#https://mailtrack.io/trace/mail/4894ba3ccb6b3e2d201f8dd4c4495bc1416aca57.png?u=9509945\"></div>\r\n"
    ]
